  "metaDescription": "The Attorney General's Office has named businessman Arif Kurniawan a suspect in a nickel mining money laundering case, seizing cash and 37.8 kg of gold.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Attorney General's Office identified Arif Kurniawan and one corporation as suspects in a nickel mining money laundering investigation.",
